OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas fair organisers cancel
OL,4,Areindeer booking
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for reindeer to be part of a
OL,7,FChristmas fair have been cancelled by
OL,8,Forganisers amid concerns about possible
OL,9,Fprotests.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Richmond Business
OL,12,Fand Tourism Association, which runs
OL,13,FRichmond Christmas Fair, said it had
OL,14,Fbeen decided not to feature the animals
OL,15,Fduring the event on Sunday 29 November
OL,16,Fin part due to "protests that were
OL,17,Fbuilding".
OL,19,FMembers of the organising committee
OL,20,Fsaid they "respect that people have
OL,21,Fdifferent views" and acknowledged the
OL,22,F"strength of feeling" over the matter.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
