OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas fair organisers cancel
OL,4,Areindeer booking
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe North East Animal Rights group was
OL,7,Famong those to have welcomed the
OL,8,Fdecision, although some on social media
OL,9,Fcriticised the move.
